 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2026 so far, March to April sat at 55% of normal on the middle of the grids and February to March at 59%. Grid 20588 had its driest year in 1965 at 69%. On grid 20888, the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 110.2.</p>"}
